/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 413 0 R
/E (simplicity. It also divides validation logic \(of instructions, registers, memory, etc.\) decreasing coupling between classes. It also allows the user to format the screen bytes into different formats like ASCII and decimal. It prints errors that happened in the machine and while loading a program to the screen in a user-friendly way using the enums and two show errors functions. It redudces the number of emums to reduce over engineering)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [8]
>>
